# PSC cache — KeyDB

This directory builds the PSC cache image (dev: `Dockerfile`, port 6379;
test: `Dockerfile.test`, port 6800) on `eqalpha/keydb`, the same image family
the rest of the suite uses (`prf-keydb`). KeyDB speaks the Redis protocol and
reads the same ACL `user` directives, so the Spring `spring.data.redis-*`
configs are unchanged. The former bitnami/redis base was removed from Docker
Hub and is gone from every compose.

# Test a connection (from inside the container)
keydb-cli -p 6379 --user psc-server --pass pscpassword ping        # dev
keydb-cli -p 6800 --user psc-server-test --pass pscpassword ping   # test
